          <title>Discharge Instructions</title>
          <text>
            <list>
              <item>Take all medications as prescribed</item>
              <item>Follow up with cardiologist in 2 weeks</item>
              <item>Cardiac rehabilitation program enrollment recommended</item>
              <item>Lifestyle modifications: smoking cessation, low-fat diet, regular exercise</item>
              <item>Monitor blood glucose and blood pressure daily</item>
              <item>Seek immediate medical attention if chest pain recurs</item>
            </list>
          </text>
